cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use DrawAI, please cite the preferred-citation paper
  (arXiv:2608.00548).
title: DrawAI
abstract: >-
  DrawAI turns raster images, including AI-generated figures and screenshots
  of paper figures or slides, into editable SVG and PPTX. The accompanying
  paper introduces DrawAI-Bench and the DrawAI-Flow reconstruction workflow.
